From 2128f4ce7773e28c83111db9b4adc00a076cfac0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:46:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 192/193] urltest modes: the fixes of the review

probesock:
- the hole list was filtered in place: a packet inside a hole wrote the
  second piece over the next hole before it was read (lost holes, losses
  counted twice); a new list now
- the socket is sealed at Finish and Close: a transport that dials later
  under the probe's context (in the background) gets an ordinary connection,
  not a capture nobody stops
- the filter takes only what the server sends to the local port, by its
  address too (another connection sharing the local port stays out); the
  local address is not matched (a source NAT rewrites it);
  PACKET_IGNORE_OUTGOING; the capture buffer passes rmem_max
- ErrNoOwnConnection for a probe over no connection of its own

loss probe:
- a body cut by the time limit while it still came (a slow path) is
  counted as far as it came; stopped only after 5 s with nothing
- ErrLossNotOwnConnection: only that rests a member for 6 h

group:
- a probe that keeps no count is recorded: the next one waits the rest
  (the interval), only the first failure in a row warns; the rest is never
  shorter than half the interval
- the probe before a switch runs in the background (the member in use
  stays, the selection runs again when it is done), once a rest per member:
  a selection no longer waits up to 2 x 45 s, a member in use that goes
  down meanwhile is left at once
- the probe waits for the slot apart from its own time; a closed group
  stores no sample
- the loss of the line is told with two counted members
- balance: the balancer is handed over on a swap with the members of the
  new group only (atomically; the old group balances no more); a dial takes
  only members of the group that are up; a member that comes in passes the
  download test; the tolerance counts from the best member that is in; the
  members are referenced (their idle connections kept) and a change is told
- balance_size at most 16, balance_idle not negative
